{"step_index":670,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T00:22:20Z","thinking":"**Verifying the API Endpoint**\n\nI'm currently double-checking the API endpoint. I'm seeing `https://transform.unstructured.io/api/v2/parse` in the URL, which has me raising an eyebrow. It seems to work, based on earlier tests. However, I'm used to seeing the general API URL at `https://api.unstructured.io/general/v0/general`. I'm starting to think the URL is not what I expected.\n\n\n**Implementing Caching Solution**\n\nI'm now focused on implementing a caching solution, specifically for repeated file uploads. The core idea is to prevent redundant API calls to `unstructured.io`. I'm going to modify `pdf_reader.py` to use a global cache directory. To identify files, I'll hash their content. The goal is that if a file with a known hash is re-uploaded, it retrieves the JSON from the cache, bypassing the API.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add MD5 caching to pdf_reader.py","EndLine":48,"Instruction":"Add md5 hashing and caching to extract_from_pdf to prevent re-uploading the same PDF","ReplacementContent":"import hashlib\n\ndef _get_file_hash(filepath: Path) -> str:\n    hasher = hashlib.md5()\n    with open(filepath, 'rb') as f:\n        buf = f.read(65536)\n        while len(buf) > 0:\n            hasher.update(buf)\n            buf = f.read(65536)\n    return hasher.hexdigest()\n\ndef extract_from_pdf(\n    filepath: Path,\n    api_key: str,\n    base_url: str = \"https://transform.unstructured.io\",\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    رفع ملف PDF إلى Unstructured API واستخراج العناصر المهيكلة.\n    \"\"\"\n    filepath = Path(filepath)\n    if not filepath.exists():\n        raise FileNotFoundError(f\"❌ ملف PDF غير موجود: {filepath}\")\n\n    # Check global cache first\n    file_hash = _get_file_hash(filepath)\n    cache_dir = filepath.parent.parent.parent / 'data' / '.unstructured_cache'\n    cache_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    cache_file = cache_dir / f\"{file_hash}.json\"\n    \n    if cache_file.exists():\n        print(f\"📄 تم العثور على الملف في الذاكرة المؤقتة (Cache). جاري تحميل البيانات المستخرجة مباشرة: {filepath.name}\")\n        with open(cache_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            result = json.load(f)\n        # Also copy to local process directory\n        json_path = filepath.with_suffix(\".json\")\n        with open(json_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as jf:\n            json.dump(result, jf, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n        return result\n\n    print(f\"📄 جارٍ رفع ملف PDF إلى Unstructured API: {filepath.name}\")\n\n    # Fallback to general API URL if transform fails or isn't correct\n    if \"transform.unstructured.io\" in base_url:\n        url = \"https://api.unstructured.io/general/v0/general\"\n    else:\n        url = f\"{base_url.rstrip('/')}/api/v2/parse\"\n        \n    headers = {\"unstructured-api-key\": api_key, \"accept\": \"application/json\"}","StartLine":19,"TargetContent":"def extract_from_pdf(\n    filepath: Path,\n    api_key: str,\n    base_url: str = \"https://transform.unstructured.io\",\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    رفع ملف PDF إلى Unstructured API واستخراج العناصر المهيكلة.\n\n    يدعم كلاً من الاستجابة الفورية (200) والمهام غير المتزامنة (202).\n\n    Args:\n        filepath: مسار ملف PDF.\n        api_key: مفتاح Unstructured API.\n        base_url: عنوان خادم Unstructured API.\n\n    Returns:\n        استجابة API كاملة (قاموس أو قائمة عناصر).\n\n    Raises:\n        FileNotFoundError: إذا لم يُوجد الملف.\n        RuntimeError: إذا فشل الاتصال بـ API أو انتهت مهلة الانتظار.\n    \"\"\"\n    filepath = Path(filepath)\n    if not filepath.exists():\n        raise FileNotFoundError(f\"❌ ملف PDF غير موجود: {filepath}\")\n\n    print(f\"📄 جارٍ رفع ملف PDF إلى Unstructured API: {filepath.name}\")\n\n    url = f\"{base_url.rstrip('/')}/api/v2/parse\"\n    headers = {\"unstructured-api-key\": api_key}","TargetFile":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\src\\extract\\pdf_reader.py","toolAction":"Add caching to pdf_reader","toolSummary":"Add PDF cache"}}]}
